license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 formalization of Proposition 2.1 in A counterexample to the
  Erdos-Mahler conjecture, conditional on explicitly stated results of
  Wu-Wang, Matolcsi-Ruzsa, Schlickewei and Matveev. Includes independent
  source reconciliation and a theorem-body audit. The manuscript's final
  Cantor construction is not formalized.
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - mathlib
  - formal verification
  - Diophantine approximation
  - Erdős–Mahler conjecture
